  partName: Gasket (3)
  description: The Gasket (3) is a large, complex component situated at the middle-center-center
    of the engine, made of metal-dark material. Its primary function is to seal the
    engine's various components, such as the cylinder head and engine block, preventing
    fluid leaks and maintaining engine pressure. Interestingly, the gasket's complex
    shape and large size allow for a high level of sealing precision, ensuring reliable
    engine operation and minimizing the risk of fluid leaks and engine damage.
